// Pro Football Fantasm First Edition — Wild Play Chart: Kicking Plays
// Canonical source-preserving WPSL migration for GCE / PFF Classic.
//
// SOURCE_TEXT is copied exactly from the supplied WildPlaysKicking.ods transcription.
// Kicking exposes new special-teams DSL requirements beyond WPSL v0.1.1.
// Draft scripts are design evidence only; they are NOT compiler-certified executable content.
// Genuine source/rule gaps remain RULING_PENDING rather than being filled by assumption.

[CHART_BEGIN]
[CHART_KEY]PFF_FIRST_EDITION_WILD_PLAY_KICKING
